// What is the probability of occurence of the (S,S) state, i.e., sunny state if the last hour was sunny, in future?
P=? [ F x=0 ]

// What is the probability of occurence of the (S,C) state, i.e., the probability of a sunny weather turning into cloudy weather in future?
P=? [ F x=1 ]

// What is the probability of occurence of the (C,S) state, i.e., the probability of a cloudy weather turning into cloudy weather in future?
P=? [ F x=3 ]

// What is the probability of occurence of the (R,R) state, i.e., rainy state if the last hour was rainy, in future?
P=? [ F x=5 ]

// What is the probability of occurence of the (R,C) state, i.e., the probability of a rainy weather turning into cloudy weather in future?
P=? [ F x=6 ]

// What is the probability of occurence of the (C,R) state, i.e., the probability of a cloudy weather turning into rainy weather in future?
P=? [ F x=4 ]

// What is the probability of occurence of the (Sn,Sn) state, i.e., snowy state if the last hour was snowy, in future?
P=? [ F x=8 ]

// What is the probability of occurence of the (Sn,R) state, i.e., the probability of a snowy weather turning into rainy weather in future?
P=? [ F x=9 ]

// What is the probability of (R,R) weather state within seven hours?
P=? [ F<=7 x=5 ]

// What is the probability of (S,S) weather state initially?
P=? [ F<1 x=0 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of (S,S) weather state within three hours?
P=? [ F<=3 x=0 ]

// What is the probability of (C,S) weather state with an initial state as (S,S)?
P=? [ F<1 x=3 ]
